                                                "sense_id": "ce1b1c56-91fb-39f7-9fc3-61287ada4427",
                                                "text": "Several attempts were made to remove the blurrings in the tomograms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b520f274-4344-46b3-babe-179eb4afb38f",
                                                "sense_id": "ce1b1c56-91fb-39f7-9fc3-61287ada4427",
                                                "text": "What's interesting is ambiguity. What's interesting is the haziness, the blurrings, the undefinables, the space and tension between people, the area between the margins that pushes us to stop, to question."
